{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06808","headline":"九日登高 · 王昌龄","name":"九日登高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山远近带皇州，霁景重阳上北楼。\n雨歇亭臯仙菊润，霜飞天苑御梨秋。\n茱萸插鬓花宜寿，翡翠横钗舞作愁。\n谩说陶潜篱下醉，何曾得见此风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}